{%- doc -%}
  Outputs the handle of a product's brand: the first collection it belongs to whose template
  suffix is `brand`. Outputs nothing when the product has no brand collection.

  @param {product} product - The product to find the brand for.

  @example
  {%- capture brand_handle -%}{%- render 'bs-product-brand', product: product -%}{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- assign brand = collections[brand_handle] -%}
{%- enddoc -%}
{%- liquid
  for collection in product.collections
    if collection.template_suffix == 'brand'
      echo collection.handle
      break
    endif
  endfor
-%}
